    "title": "Beat Shoot 3D:EDM Music Game",
    "description": "Try great time killer game now! Beat Shoot 3D combines one-finger control gameplay with beautiful music and gun sounds, help you relaxing and feeling comfortable.\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n- Block tiles come with EDM music.\r\n- Break the tiles by sliding your finger exactly.\r\n- Do not miss any tiles to keep the game going.\r\n- Each song has been designed with addictive challenges, enjoy it!\r\n- Collect coins for unlocking new songs.\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n- FNF Story mode challenge characters to rescue  your girlfriend.\r\n- Play with friends or online player around the world.\r\n- Upload own songs from your music library.\r\n- Fantastic EDM music and gun-sound effects.\r\n- Easy to play, one-finger control.\r\n- Cool Skins and Weapons for you select.\r\n\r\nIf you are not steady, don't play it, you will be addicted it \ud83d\ude0a\r\nIf any producer or label has an issue with any of the music used in the game, please send email to us and it will be deleted immediately if necessary.\r\n\r\nContact us:\r\nAre you having problems? Please send an email to beatfunvn@outlook.com",
